        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within a small enclave of similar-style homes overlooking a well-maintained green area, this two-storey semi-detached home enjoys a quiet residential setting within one of the Dunmore Road’s most established developments.\r\n\r\nPositioned close to the entrance of the estate, the property enjoys an exceptionally convenient location on the Dunmore Road. It is within walking distance of the urban village of Ardkeen, University Hospital Waterford, excellent primary and secondary schools and the Maypark Trail. A regular bus service from the entrance to the development provides convenient access to both the hospital and Waterford city centre, while the Outer Ring Road is also within easy reach.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nInside, the accommodation is bright and well proportioned, with the added benefit of a valuable second reception room at ground floor level. This versatile space can be adapted to suit a variety of needs, whether as a home office, playroom, TV room or gym.\r\n\r\nThe main living accommodation is nicely interconnected, creating a natural flow while still providing defined living spaces. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from a lawned garden and off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe rear garden is spacious and private, with an attractive original stone wall feature adding character and creating an appealing outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining or family use.\r\n\r\nOffering flexible accommodation, a mature setting and an exceptionally convenient location close to schools, healthcare facilities, shops and transport links, this is a home that combines everyday practicality with an excellent quality of life.\r\n\r\n***Liberty Blue Estate Agents and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied upon as a representation of fact. Subject to contract. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must satisfy themselves as to the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs are provided for guidance purposes only.***"
      },
